# Ownership of sensitive operating surfaces.
#
# MainTemplate is a GitHub Template Repository. A generated repository must
# replace @anthracite-labs below with its own owning user or team, otherwise
# these rules will not resolve. This file remains required: scripts/repo-check
# enforces its presence and /AGENTS.md maps it as a current enforcement
# surface, so substitute the owner rather than deleting the file.
/AGENTS.md @anthracite-labs
/.gitattributes @anthracite-labs
/.agents/ @anthracite-labs
/.github/ @anthracite-labs
/scripts/ @anthracite-labs
/docs/ @anthracite-labs
